  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DZqo5E4.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x2jQAIf.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/SWUTM1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/SWUTM1?color=yellow&label=Twitter&logo=twitter&logoColor=blue&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"44\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fswutm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Telegram-2CA5E0?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white\" width=\"196\" height=\"43\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCE3FisP1MrVri5WlQ8euuLA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCE3FisP1MrVri5WlQ8euuLA?color=yellow&label=YouTube&logo=youtube&logoColor=blue&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"215\" height=\"44\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/P7VRrxKdCS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/948491825046499349?color=yellow&label=Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=blue&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"305\" height=\"44\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/swutm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=swutm&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"44\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Этот мод добавляет в игру 5 ускорителей, которые упростят&nbsp;<span>производство</span>&nbsp;ресурсов, например, со временем уголь превращается в алмаз, а череп скелета-иссушителя — в звезду Незера.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Ускоритель</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LtkIdHc.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WlGfvoi.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sg3aYSe.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y2gcrWq.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7byeaBz.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PDqnB4U.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2PzZGNT.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YLalFB7.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cqSHBgO.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Is2v2tW.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GzV2spW.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6MI79EY.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wKaRfVK.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/55KzBmt.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LoeubvJ.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WBBtdOP.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lUvYI5i.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eGIYGDd.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OwfnsK3.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nix6AkV.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s8aZkwr.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8reezvY.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/z7sv2nf.png\"><br>Предохранитель<br>Защитите ваши механизмы от побочных эффектов.</span></pre>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Нажмите правой кнопкой мыши по активному ускорителю.<br>Голосование<br></span></pre>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.survio.com%252fsurvey%252fd%252fJ9A6W1V3K6R4L7E2N%253fpreview%253d1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>https://www.survio.com/survey/d/J9A6W1V3K6R4L7E2N?preview=1</span></a><br></span